    "공항·숙소·식당·교통·쇼핑·관광·긴급 상황까지, 배우는 모든 언어로 열려요.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Airports, hotels, restaurants, transport, shopping, sightseeing and emergencies, unlocked in every language you learn."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aeropuertos, hoteles, restaurantes, transporte, compras, turismo y emergencias, en todos los idiomas que aprendes."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bandara, hotel, restoran, transportasi, belanja, wisata, sampai darurat, terbuka di semua bahasa yang kamu pelajari."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空港・宿泊・レストラン・交通・買い物・観光・緊急時まで、学ぶすべての言語で使えます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "机场、住宿、餐厅、交通、购物、观光、紧急情况，所有学习语言全部开放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "관리할 표현이 없어요": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
